I spot checked like this:

problems with P1733a Fusion Dance
can't find email for leader of Boston Fusion Dance Community

click the link which goes to the application.  Notice the group name "Boston Fusion Dance Community".  It matched in the database, so there's a pcode in the pink box and  link to cgi next to it.  Click that, which goes to the cgi index page.  Indeed, there's no email address for this group.

At the database level, the pcode shows the performer number is 12273, so in the neffa database:

mysql> select performerName, email from performers where number = 12273;
+-------------------------------+-------+
| performerName                 | email |
+-------------------------------+-------+
| Boston Fusion Dance Community |       |
+-------------------------------+-------+
1 row in set (0.00 sec)

Let me know if there's some other step I'm supposed to do to find an email

